      "id": "bea12bf9-402d-4a73-aace-46436e2a5572",
      "name": "taxonomy",
      "description": {
        "content": "Categories and tags. The hierarchical `category` taxonomy holds 10 terms and carries all classification; the flat `post_tag` taxonomy is registered but empty (0 terms).",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
